    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RVSD \u2014 tactical action about FPV drones</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story campaign. Rise from a scout to a fighter and missile gunner, completing increasingly difficult missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five drone classes. Scout, kamikaze, gunner, bomber-grenadier and fighter \u2014 each with its own role and tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization. Adjust drone parameters and mission conditions to suit your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies. Tanks, infantry, ships, enemy EW drones and ground-based air defense systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tense atmosphere. Sound, graphics and small details convey the feeling of a real battle.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RVSD \u2014 tactical action about FPV drones</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story campaign. Rise from a scout to a fighter and missile gunner, completing increasingly difficult missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five drone classes. Scout, kamikaze, gunner, bomber-grenadier and fighter \u2014 each with its own role and tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization. Adjust drone parameters and mission conditions to suit your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies. Tanks, infantry, ships, enemy EW drones and ground-based air defense systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tense atmosphere. Sound, graphics and small details convey the feeling of a real battle.</p></li></ul>",
